Two clusters may look alike (e.g. 'late up' and 'gradual up'): k-means always
 returns k groups. Try k = 3, 5, 6 and keep the k whose shapes you can name.
Next step (exercise): run ORA per cluster with org.Mm.eg.db as in module 06,
 using all LRT-tested genes as the universe.

